2026/Jun/29 05:51:02.786376 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:226 *** Purpose: Verify MS reports time difference (motdif) after non-sync HO ***
2026/Jun/29 05:51:02.786380 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:227 *** TWO_CELL: ARFCN 51 (Cell A main BTS) + ARFCN 56 (Cell B n56 BTS) ***
2026/Jun/29 05:51:02.786384 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:228 *** FH-SKIP: C_Test_fh preamble and TCH hopping approximated as h=0 fixed ***
2026/Jun/29 05:51:02.786388 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:229 ==========================================================
2026/Jun/29 05:51:02.786392 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:230 *** Spec comments: ***
2026/Jun/29 05:51:02.786396 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:231 ***   1. Cell A with BCCH, CCCH, SDCCH4 and a traffic channel ***
2026/Jun/29 05:51:02.786400 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:232 ***   2. Cell B with BCCH, CCCH, SDCCH4 and a traffic channel ***
2026/Jun/29 05:51:02.786403 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:233 ***   3. In cell A the timing advance = TSPX_y3 (=20) ***
2026/Jun/29 05:51:02.786407 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:234 ***   4. non-synch, rot=1, nci=0, handover reference = TSPX_HoRefB ***
2026/Jun/29 05:51:02.786411 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:235 ==========================================================
2026/Jun/29 05:51:02.786415 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:240 *** FH-SKIP: Spec uses C_Test_fh (hopping channel). Virtual BTS enforces h=0 (fixed channel). ***
